{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57348","headline":"丑妇赋 · 刘思真","name":"丑妇赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人皆得令室，我命独何[咎]（吝）（从安刻本改）。\n不遇姜任德，正值丑恶妇。\n才质陋且俭，姿容剧嫫母。\n鹿头猕猴面，推额复出口。\n折頞靥楼鼻，两眼䫜（一交切）如臼。\n肤如老桑皮，耳如侧两手。\n头如研米槌，发如掘扫帚。\n恶观丑仪容，不媚似铺首。\n闇钝拙梳髻，刻画又更丑。\n妆颊如狗舐，额上独偏厚。\n朱唇如踏血，画眉如鼠负。\n傅粉堆颐下，面中不徧有。\n领如盐豉囊，袖如常拭釜。\n履中如和泥，爪甲长有垢。\n脚皲可容箸，熟视今人呕。\n（见《初学记》卷十九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘思真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}